# poem_agent/README.md
# Intelligent AI Poem Channel Management Agent

This project implements a secure, modular poetry management system with an AI-powered task orchestration layer, memory, poetry analysis, image matching, Telegram integration and approval gates.

## Features

- General-purpose AI agent with planning and security checks
- Multi-model brain and model router
- Hybrid memory: SQL + vector + knowledge + episodic memory
- Poetry collection, classification, quality analysis and duplicate detection
- Image discovery and validation with licensing checks
- Telegram channel management and scheduling
- Owner approval before destructive actions
- Tests and line-check enforcement

## Structure

- `config/` configuration and prompts
- `core/` agent, AI brain, planning and task management
- `memory/` hybrid storage and vector retrieval
- `poetry/` poem engine and ranking logic
- `media/` image discovery and validation
- `channel/` publish and approval workflows
- `telegram/` bot and spider indicator
- `tools/` tool registry and skill manager
- `storage/` SQLite repository and models
- `security/` permission and policy enforcement
- `tests/` automated checks

## Quick start

```bash
cd poem_agent
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
python main.py --demo
```

## Notes

The system is intentionally provider-agnostic and keeps credentials in environment variables only.
